00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.160
Why?

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:01.590
It is said that the human realm does not contain much magical energy.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:02.910
Is that so?

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:07.670
Then, I'd have to do <i>that</i>.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:12.110
But even then, I couldn't sense much magical energy from humans.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:17.430
Um, I'll leave the towel here.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.430
Then, for a change of clothes.

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.430
It'll be fine if you enter the bath, too.

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.920
I'm fine!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.440
Adorable!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:32.270
Mercelida-sama, that boy has some strong magical reserves.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.370
I know that.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.950
But...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.870
H-Here you go.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:39.950
Thank you.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:43.610
What's wrong?

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.010
N-Nothing...

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:48.340
I was just wondering if Onee-san is a fairy or something like that.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:49.210
Why is that?

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:55.130
That's because you appeared from the light.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.650
That's correct.

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:01.140
I'm a fairy of the forest and also...

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:03.600
...a queen!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.590
A-A queen?!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:08.400
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.250
I'm not able to assist you well enough...

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.900
Adorable...

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.700
Which means that you're very busy, right?

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.810
And I even dragged you back to my home.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.010
I'm sorry!

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:21.700
I'm fine. Don't worry about it.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.160
That's because I have yet to...

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:27.160
Truthfully, I'm not yet a queen.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.650
I never had any plans to become a queen.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.210
And I don't feel like becoming one.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.130
That's why I ran away.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.800
But wouldn't everyone else be worried,

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.640
if you suddenly disappeared?

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.640
There isn't anyone who would be...

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.500
But...

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:52.400
There isn't anyone who would be truly concerned about me.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.550
I had two elder sisters.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:59.440
We used to play together when we were children.

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:06.700
Honestly, one of them should have had become a queen.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:07.580
Onee-san...

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.080
We were so close and yet...

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:14.100
Being used by the people around us...

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:16.130
There was a big fight...

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:20.900
It was stupid.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:22.510
Why did they become like that?

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:26.260
What sisters? What royalty?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:30.270
If only we hadn't been born...

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:36.020
Don't cry.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:40.160
I didn't know, and yet I still asked you about it...

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.560
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.030
Why are you apologising?

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:46.740
I made you sad.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.040
Why are you hugging me?

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.860
My mother used to hug me when I cried.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:56.090
Is that so?

00:19:58.960 --> 00:19:59.840
Onee-san!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:01.340
Thank you.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.090
It's nothing.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.000
I'm being comforted by such a small child...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.850
What am I doing?

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.610
He fell asleep.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.700
I'm sorry, but even if you woke up now,

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.130
it'd all just be part of a dream.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.390
This place is...

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.390
This is the inside of a dream.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.400
We're both having the same dream.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.310
The same dream?

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.580
That's right.

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:04.000
Onee-san...

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.490
How are you feeling?

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:09.700
I feel light and fluffy.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.060
Kind of mysterious...

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:17.320
...but a happy feeling.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:19.070
It's warm.

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:22.210
You're the one who is warm.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:26.560
This is the first time I've ever had such a warm dream.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.700
Yes.

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:30.640
Me too.

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:44.940
Was that a... dream?

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:56.650
Good work during the coronation ceremony.

00:21:56.650 --> 00:21:58.440
Yeah.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:00.540
What's wrong?

00:22:01.060 --> 00:22:04.960
I'm thinking about if I should have asked for that kid's name.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:07.500
Gosh, Merce-sama!

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.970
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:27.950
Before, I was able to live these black and white days normally,

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:37.000
but now I cannot imagine life without you.

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:46.630
You gave me this palm-sized piece of love.

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.100
I won't let it fall from my grasp...

00:22:53.260 --> 00:23:02.690
You filled my midsummer photographs with colour.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:12.120
I want to hold every last shining moment close to my heart.

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:21.790
The tears, mistakes and loneliness I experienced in the past...

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:31.130
...brought me the happiness that now lays in my hand.

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:41.390
They all made it possible for the two of us to be brought together on this day.
